# Testing rules

- Test domain invariants, not only implementation details.
- Billing tests must cover concurrency, duplicate events, reservation/settlement/release, insufficient allowance, failed provider calls, top-up ordering and period expiry.
- Add integration tests against PostgreSQL for transaction/locking behavior; mocks alone are insufficient for financial concurrency.
- Payment webhook tests must prove duplicate delivery is idempotent.
- Provider adapter tests use fixtures/fakes and never require paid live calls in the default test suite.
- Worker tests cover retries/restarts/idempotency.
- Each bug in billing/security should receive a regression test.
- Keep smoke tests for `/health`, DB connectivity and Redis connectivity where appropriate.
